[I] Intel processor microcode update tool for Linux

[T] iucode-tool manipulates collections of Intel i686/x86-64 processor
[T] microcode updates, allowing selection, conversion and preparation of
[T] microcode data for use by the Linux kernel's early microcode loader.

[U] https://gitlab.com/iucode-tool/iucode-tool

[A] Henrique de Moraes Holschuh <hmh@hmh.eng.br>
